{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52264","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐史非（一作「作」）台补，任官州县上。\n未是好出身，丁儿避征防。\n不虑弃家门，狗偷且求养。\n每日求行案，寻常恐迸仗。\n食即衆厨飡，童儿更护当。\n有事检（一作「机」）案追，出帖付里正。\n火急捉将来，险语唯须胱（一作「就」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}